Z||000020||chester||12-28-2001||06:38 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tina:<BR><B>Doesn't look like that there is enough room for the 3rd brake light, or is there?<P>Either way, I like the look.<P><BR>Tina   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>BTW do you have anymore pic's of it.<BR>( seat moved forward and out of the way, and a view thru back window from the outside)</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I had to remove the third brake light.  Have no idea on how anyone used the stock one.  I was coming up about 1" too narrow between the roof and the bar.  Sooo....I went with a high intensity LED third brake light. Looks sweet.<P>Rob D.<P>||||reg||1
